p.src:
The loop is: $\text{Ask}
\longrightarrow
\text{Listen}
\longrightarrow
\text{Tailor}
\longrightarrow
\text{Respect}
\longrightarrow
\text{Engage}.$ He asks questions, listens to the response, and tailors the message to the buyer’s needs. The respect term is essential. White says he does not want to tell people what they do not want to know, nor tell them something they already know better than he does.

